---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { doctor, proof, bookingHref } from '../data/site.js';
import Figure from '../components/Figure.astro';

// Verified against original certificates. Do not inflate.
const timeline = [
  ['2010', 'MBBS', 'J.J.M. Medical College, Davangere (Rajiv Gandhi University of Health Sciences). All four phases cleared at first attempt.'],
  ['2011–12', 'Rotating internship', 'Bapuji Hospital and Chigateri District General Hospital — general medicine, surgery, paediatrics, obstetrics and community medicine.'],
  ['2012', 'Registered with the Delhi Medical Council', 'Registration No. 57994.'],
  ['2017', 'DDVL — Dermatology, Venereology and Leprology', 'J.J.M. Medical College, Davangere. Passed at first attempt.'],
  ['2017 onward', 'Dermatology practice in Delhi', 'Clinics in Narela and Rohini, and online consultations across India.'],
];
---

<Base
  title="About Dr Hitesh Aggarwal"
  description="Dermatologist in Delhi since 2017. Medical dermatology — hair loss, acne, pigmentation, psoriasis and eczema — plus second opinions and online consultations across India."
  slug="about"
  pageType="about"
>
  <section class="wrap band" style="padding-bottom:0">
    <div
      style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:clamp(24px,3vw,48px); align-items:center"
    >
      <div>
        <h1>Dr Hitesh Aggarwal</h1>
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:12px">
          Dermatologist · {doctor.qualifications} · {doctor.registration}
        </p>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px">
          A doctor since {doctor.registeredSince} and a dermatologist since {doctor.practisingSince}.
          Most of the practice is medical dermatology — conditions that have already been treated
          once or twice without a clear diagnosis.
        </p>
        <div class="actions" style="margin-top:22px">
          <a
            class="btn btn-primary"
            href="/consult-online/"
            data-track="cta_clicked"
            data-label="consult_online"
            data-placement="about_hero">Consult online</a
          >
          <a
            class="btn btn-secondary"
            href={bookingHref()}
            rel="noopener"
            data-track="booking_started"
            data-mode="clinic"
            data-placement="about_hero">Book at a clinic</a
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <Figure id="about-portrait" ratio="4 / 5" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="prose" style="padding-block:clamp(32px,5vw,56px) 0">
    <h2>Training</h2>
    <p>
      He completed his MBBS at J.J.M. Medical College, Davangere, clearing every phase at the
      first attempt, followed by a rotating internship across general medicine, surgery,
      paediatrics, obstetrics and community medicine.
    </p>
    <p>
      He returned to J.J.M. for postgraduate training in Dermatology, Venereology and Leprology,
      again passing at the first attempt. The dermatology department there runs four units within
      a 2,900-bed teaching hospital, with dedicated cosmetology and dermatosurgery clinics
      alongside general dermatology.
    </p>
    <p>
      He managed inpatient wards as well as outpatient clinics — which means training on severe
      and complicated disease, not only routine skin care. Aesthetic clinics rarely see the
      inpatient side of dermatology at all.
    </p>

    <h2>Credentials</h2>
    <table>
      <tbody>
        {
          timeline.map(([year, what, detail]) => (
            <tr>
              <th scope="row" style="width:22%">{year}</th>
              <td>
                <strong style="color:var(--ink)">{what}</strong>
                <br />
                {detail}
              </td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <p style="font-size:var(--t-small)">
      Registration can be verified on the Delhi Medical Council register under number 57994.
    </p>

    <h2>How he works</h2>
    <p>
      Most patients arrive having already tried something that did not work — often several
      things. The first job is establishing what the problem actually is, which sometimes means
      revisiting a previous diagnosis. The second is explaining it clearly enough that the
      treatment makes sense and gets followed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Where a treatment carries real risks — isotretinoin, anti-androgens, long-term steroid use
      — those are discussed before it starts rather than after.
      <a href="/conditions/finasteride-dutasteride-side-effects/">
        There is a page on exactly that for hair loss medication.
      </a>
    </p>
    <p>
      Second opinions make up a large part of the practice.
      <a href="/second-opinions/">More on how those are approached.</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Teaching</h2>
    <p>
      He taught medical students and internees during his postgraduate training, and continues to
      run facial aesthetics workshops for practising doctors.
      <a href="/for-doctors/">Details for doctors.</a>
    </p>

    <h2>Where he practises</h2>
    <p>
      Two clinics in Delhi — <a href="/clinics/">Narela in the morning and Rohini in the
      evening</a> — and <a href="/consult-online/">online consultations</a> for patients anywhere
      in India.
    </p>
    <p>
      Across the two clinics, {proof.totalReviews} Google reviews at an average of {proof.averageRating}.
    </p>
  </div>

  <section class="band-mist" style="margin-top:48px">
    <div class="prose band">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Start here</h2>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <a class="card" href="/conditions/" data-track="internal_link_clicked" data-label="conditions">
          <h4>Conditions</h4>
          <p>Start with the problem you have.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/consult-online/" data-track="internal_link_clicked" data-label="consult">
          <h4>Consult online</h4>
          <p>How a video consultation works.</p>
        </a>
        <a class="card" href="/second-opinions/" data-track="internal_link_clicked" data-label="second_opinion">
          <h4>Second opinions</h4>
          <p>Treated already, without improvement.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
